  "arms": "One frozen model; Torch fallback, native FLA, then FP32-input FLA. Same four non-benchmark cases in original/reversed batch row order. Full vocabulary projection, BF16 base, unmerged LoRA, native cache, complete prompts and T=1. No labels enter inference.",
